    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain proficiency in one of the following skills of your choice: Deception, Intimidation, or Persuasion. In addition, when you make an ability check with the chosen skill, you gain a bonus to the check equal to your Intelligence modifier (minimum of +1).</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-TcWfxNQTozvV7Cxo\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Turn on the effect of the chosen skill only.</p></section>",
